    24→
    25→/**
    26→ * Unified icon button for collapsed sidebar.
    27→ * Modeled after McpStatusIndicator for consistent behavior.
    28→ *
    29→ * IMPORTANT: Parent must wrap this in a centering container:
    30→ * <div className="grid place-items-center w-full">
    31→ *   <SidebarIconButton ... />
    32→ * </div>
